  "description": "Upgrade your 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab or 2020-2026 2500HD/3500HD (excluding 2019 1500 LD/Limited) with OEDRO Running Boards. Crafted from heavy-duty steel with a corrosion-resistant powder-coated finish, these drop-down steps are designed to withstand the elements and provide easy access to your vehicle. With an extended pedal design, they offer superior convenience for both standard and lifted vehicles, enhancing accessibility and protection.\nFeatures\n6-Inch Side Pedals for Enhanced Accessibility: The two-step design offers superior convenience, making it easier to get in and out of lifted vehicles or those with oversized tires. Perfect for added accessibility and safety.\nThree-Tube Construction for Maximum Protection: The innovative three-tube design provides additional protection for the undercarriage and sides of your vehicle, preventing damage from obstacles while off-roading or parking in tight spaces.\nBolt-On Installation for Easy Setup: With a bolt-fixed installation and welded brackets, these running boards provide a secure, no-drill solution that ensures extra strength and stability.\nBuilt to Last: Constructed with a rust-resistant, powder-coated finish, these running boards are designed to handle harsh weather conditions, making them durable enough for daily use or off-road adventures.\nLaser-Cut Tread for Superior Traction: The anti-slip tread step surface offers superior grip, ensuring safe entry and exit from your vehicle in any condition, from wet to muddy environments.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado /GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Chevy Silverado / GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD(Excl. 2019 1500 LD/Limited)\nFor models from 2017 and later, trimming is needed on the plastic DEF tank cover.\nThe side steps need to be removed from the factory rock rail before installation.",
